  "隐私提示：问题包只保存在本机，管理器和命令行都不会上传它。\n包含硬件、macOS / HVF / Metal、组件版本、实例配置白名单和经过脱敏的本目录模拟器日志。不会收集磁盘镜像、截图、账号配置、进程环境、系统崩溃转储或其他应用日志。\n常见凭据字段、路径和设备标识会被过滤；上传前仍请检查全部内容。": "Privacy note: the problem report stays on this computer only; neither the manager nor the command line uploads it.\nIt contains hardware, macOS / HVF / Metal, component versions, an allowlist of instance settings and redacted emulator logs of this folder. It does not collect disk images, screenshots, account settings, process environments, system crash dumps or other apps' logs.\nCommon credential fields, paths and device identifiers are filtered; still check everything before uploading.",
  "隐私提示：问题包只保存在本机，管理器和命令行都不会上传它。\r\n- 里面有：summary.txt（电脑和模拟器的情况）、模拟器日志、实例配置；找到 AUTO-MAS 时还有它的日志（mas 文件夹）；有实例在运行时还有现场截图和安卓状态（live 文件夹）；模拟器近 7 天崩溃过的话还有崩溃转储（crash 文件夹）。不收磁盘镜像，不收 AUTO-MAS 的配置和账号数据，也不会有意收集账号密码。\r\n- 这些文件里都有本机路径，路径里可能有 Windows 用户名；截图和 AUTO-MAS 日志里可能有游戏账号名。\r\n- 可以公开：在 GitHub Issue（https://github.com/ModAVD/ModAVD/issues）里贴 summary.txt 和日志，或者上传删掉 crash 文件夹后的问题包。上传前看一眼，不想公开的内容先删掉。\r\n- 不要公开：crash 文件夹（崩溃转储，含模拟器进程的线程栈和少量内存片段）。带 crash 文件夹的完整问题包请发邮件到 qiyinxi@foxmail.com，邮件里写上 Issue 编号。": "Privacy note: the problem report stays on this computer only; neither the manager nor the command line uploads it.\r\n- It contains: summary.txt (the state of the computer and emulator), emulator logs, instance settings; when AUTO-MAS is found, its logs (the mas folder); when instances are running, live screenshots and Android state (the live folder); when the emulator crashed in the last 7 days, crash dumps (the crash folder). It does not include disk images or AUTO-MAS settings and account data, and does not intentionally collect account names or passwords.\r\n- These files contain local paths, which may include your Windows user name; screenshots and AUTO-MAS logs may show game account names.\r\n- Safe to publish: paste summary.txt and the logs into a GitHub issue (https://github.com/ModAVD/ModAVD/issues), or upload the problem report with the crash folder removed. Check it first and delete anything you do not want public.\r\n- Do not publish: the crash folder (crash dumps with thread stacks and small memory fragments of the emulator process). Send the full problem report with the crash folder by email to qiyinxi@foxmail.com and put the issue number in the email.",
